  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exercise Tropic Twilight 2025 Cook Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exercise Tropic Twilight is an opportunity for NZDF to partner with other nations, especially the Cook Islands, to deliver on activities beneficial to Pa Enua communities. In the delivery of Tropic Twilight, NZDF will lead while integrating&#xa0;on construction tasks. This approach reinforces&#xa0;NZ&apos;s values and the development principle of partnership.&#xa0;It will also demonstrate NZ&apos;s commitment to the Pacific, and supporting partners&#x2019; resilience and readiness to prepare and respond to natural disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
